WEBVTT

00:32:26.918 --> 00:32:30.998
have been the public interest

00:32:30.998 --> 00:32:33.941
and the principles that underly

00:32:33.941 --> 00:32:37.217
the journalistic establishment in the United States

00:32:37.217 --> 00:32:39.663
and around the world,

00:32:39.663 --> 00:32:44.508
and I think if the press is now saying,

00:32:44.508 --> 00:32:46.590
we support this,

00:32:46.590 --> 00:32:48.678
this is something that needed to happen,

00:32:48.678 --> 00:32:51.322
that's a powerful argument,
but it's not the final argument,

00:32:51.322 --> 00:32:54.035
and I think that's something
that public should decide.

00:32:54.035 --> 00:32:55.877
But at the same time,

00:32:55.877 --> 00:32:57.423
the government has hinted that they want

00:32:57.423 --> 00:32:59.267
some kind of deal,

00:32:59.267 --> 00:33:01.381
that they want me to compromise